<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>PhpExcel on Wkii Blog</title><link>https://www.wkii.net/tags/phpexcel/</link><description>Recent content in PhpExcel on Wkii Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 07 Aug 2013 16:47:08 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.wkii.net/tags/phpexcel/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>php生成excel列名，超过26列大于Z的方法</title><link>https://www.wkii.net/posts/php/php-excel-create-column-name-by-php/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 Aug 2013 16:47:08 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://www.wkii.net/posts/php/php-excel-create-column-name-by-php/</guid><description>&lt;p>这是phpExcel类中的方法。今天查到了，记录一下备忘。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
